            "https://github.com/bbepis/XUnity.AutoTranslator/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md"
          ],
          "note": "XUnity.AutoTranslator 5.3.0 'Dropped support for pre-2017 Unity Engine versions for IL2CPP versions'. The floor is inherited by anything stacked on top of BepInEx 6 IL2CPP."
